{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Hats & Headwear|$Boreworm Mask}}

Boreworm Mask is unique armorpiece that can equipped onto 1R slot. Giving good bonus at [[Strength]] and [[Masonry]]

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{_{q}Boreworm Beak+ _{q}String}{2}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity *Survival}</math>

* Bonuses = <math>_{q10}Bonuses*\sqrt{\frac{_{q}Mask }{10}}</math>.

